---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-ink-200 bg-ink-50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-12">
    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-4">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-base font-semibold text-ink-900">
          <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500 to-primary-600 text-white">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="h-4 w-4">
              <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7" />
              <path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          DocMind
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-500">
          本地优先的文档智能搜索<br />全文 · 语义 · AI 问答
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-500">产品</h4>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-700">
          <li><a class="hover:text-ink-900" href="/features">功能</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-ink-900" href="/pricing">定价</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-ink-900" href="/download">下载</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-ink-900" href="/changelog">更新日志</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-500">资源</h4>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-700">
          <li><a class="hover:text-ink-900" href="/docs">使用文档</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-ink-900" href="/docs/faq">常见问题</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-ink-900" href="/contact">联系我们</a></li>
          <li>
            <a
              class="hover:text-ink-900"
              href="https://api.docmind.app/activate"
            >
              激活 license
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-500">法律</h4>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-700">
          <li><a class="hover:text-ink-900" href="/privacy">隐私政策</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-ink-900" href="/terms">服务条款</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-ink-200 pt-6 text-sm text-ink-500">
      <span>© {year} DocMind · 保留所有权利</span>
      <span class="font-mono text-xs">made for local-first knowledge</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
